# Jace's Machinations reaches only "Jace planeswalkers you control", and only "until end of turn" (CR 606.3, 611.2c,
# 514.2).
#
# Bot1 casts Liliana of the Veil on turn one; Bot2 casts Jace, the Mind Sculptor on turn two. In Bot2's end step Bot1
# casts the Machinations and gets a Jace token. Bot1 may then activate the token's -1 there, but not Liliana's abilities:
# she is no Jace. Bot2, though it is Bot2's own turn, may not activate its Mind Sculptor in its end step: the permission
# is Bot1's alone, and Bot2's Jace is not one Bot1 controls.
#
# On turn three the permission is gone: in Bot1's upkeep the token's abilities are not offered (a new turn, so the one
# activation a turn is not what refuses them), while in Bot1's main phase they are, at sorcery speed as usual.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Liliana of the Veil
Jace's Machinations
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Jace, the Mind Sculptor
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Liliana of the Veil.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Jace, the Mind Sculptor.Cast
[T2 Bot2.End]
Bot1.Hand.Jace's Machinations.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
Bot2.Pass
! Bot2.Battlefield.Jace, the Mind Sculptor.Activate
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Battlefield.Liliana of the Veil.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Jace Token.Activate(Ability: Surveil)
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Jace Token.Counters.Loyalty = 7
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Jace Token.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Jace Token.Activate(Ability: Surveil)
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Jace Token.Counters.Loyalty = 6
Bot1.Battlefield.Liliana of the Veil.Counters.Loyalty = 3
Bot2.Battlefield.Jace, the Mind Sculptor.Counters.Loyalty = 3
